# Gửi tin Tư vấn đính kèm file
để gửi thông báo đính kèm file, bạn cần sử dụng API upload file.

## Example request [​](https://stc-developers.zdn.vn/docs/v2/official-account/tin-nhan/tin-tu-van/gui-tin-tu-van-dinh-kem-file?lang=vi&ts=1785208077367#example-request)
```bash
curl \
-X POST \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-H 'access_token: <your_access_token>' \
-d '{
  "recipient": {
    "user_id": "2468458835296117922"
  },
  "message": {
    "attachment": {
        "type": "file",
        "payload": {
            "token": "12i8LV3BcmmDS4iLfyoU3qKxHXNtpu077ZjA7xRHmmi8EXrEjuR50LHjJXJWWvTQ17OJ7R2Oc5q4SHSJjPoPKmDq5X2tyS4MI78oKexCna1CUJnQyiMvUKmfG7UOX8PYVW5FJAckbWbi1tWbj8BnCNOyTGMBr8mrG5XZ4epkfbD4HczzjUs3FM0QL1ZM"
        }
    }
  }
}' "https://openapi.zalo.me/v3.0/oa/message/cs"
```

### Cấu trúc thuộc tính message [​](https://stc-developers.zdn.vn/docs/v2/official-account/tin-nhan/tin-tu-van/gui-tin-tu-van-dinh-kem-file?lang=vi&ts=1785208077367#c%E1%BA%A5u-tr%C3%BAc-thu%E1%BB%99c-t%C3%ADnh-message)
| **Tham số** | **Kiểu dữ liệu** | **Tính bắt buộc** | **Mô tả** |
|-|-|-|-|
| attachment | object | yes | Attachment cần gửi |

## HTTP request[Direct link to heading](https://developers.esms.vn/en/esms-api/send-sms-api/send-zalo-message-with-attached-photo#http-request)
```
curl --location 'http://rest.esms.vn/MainService.svc/json/SendZaloFollowerMessage_V5_post_json/' \
--header 'Content-Type: text/plain' \
--header 'Cookie: ASP.NET_SessionId=asfgp2dj1kt4kbg1yzuo35ky; ASP.NET_SessionId=5xcbl12ska5q5wocug3chmjz' \
--data '{
    "ApiKey": "{{ApiKey}}",
    "SecretKey": "{{SecretKey}}",
    "OAID": "{{OAID}}",
    "CallbackUrl": "{{CallbackUrl}}",
    "RequestId": "{{RequestId}}",
    "Payload": {
        "recipient": {
            "user_id": "{{user_id}}"
        },
        "message": {
            "text": "{{text}}",
            "attachment": {
                "type": "template",
                "payload": {
                    "template_type": "media",
                    "elements": [\
                        {\
                            "media_type": "image",\
                            "url": "{{url}}"\
                        }\
                    ]
                }
            }
        }
    }
}'
```

